        "Body": {
          "ContentType": "html",
          "Content": "<div>In early June 2026, the following update and enhancement was made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;<br></div><br><div>Now you can use post-quantum resilient AES 256 symmetric keys to configure transparent data encryption (TDE) with customer-managed keys in Azure SQL Database.&nbsp;<br></div><br><a href=\"https://aka.ms/AESKeyPreviewBlog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.&nbsp;<br>",
          "Markdown": "In early June 2026, the following update and enhancement was made to Azure SQL:\n\nNow you can use post-quantum resilient AES 256 symmetric keys to configure transparent data encryption (TDE) with customer-managed keys in Azure SQL Database.\n\nLearn more ."
